/ Abstract base class representing a generic sensor.
//
// This class defines a common interface that all sensor
// types must implement, regardless of how they collect data.
//
// Examples of derived sensor types:
// - GPS Sensor
// - IMU Sensor
// - Altimeter Sensor
// - Magnetometer Sensor
//
// By defining a common interface, the Mission Controller
// can interact with all sensors in a consistent manner.
class Sensor
{
public:

    // Pure virtual function that forces all derived
    // sensor classes to implement their own update logic.
    //
    // The update() function is responsible for:
    // - Reading new sensor measurements
    // - Processing sensor data
    // - Updating the UAV state information
    //
    // Because every sensor gathers data differently,
    // each derived class provides its own implementation.
    virtual void update() = 0;
};
